{"unit_id":"Andy-scy__harmonyos-ui-icons#card-zh","repo":"Andy-scy/harmonyos-ui-icons","commit":"fad59140c464576a0f756f9ad948bc8021ce6bb3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"HarmonyOS UI Icons (Iconsax) 是面向鸿蒙与 ArkTS 界面开发的 DSH 技能包，通过 bundle 挂载随包技能目录，提供 Iconsax 图标获取、样式上色和 SVG 动效生成能力。开发者可初始化精选图标、按名称和样式下载 SVG、生成浮动或呼吸等 SMIL 动效，并参考 ArkTS 图标组件与着色模板。适合制作鸿蒙页面、导航和控件；首次取图标需要联网访问官方 CDN，无需配置 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-20","skills/harmonyos-ui-icons/scripts/bootstrap.mjs:94-114","skills/harmonyos-ui-icons/templates/IconsaxIcon.ets:51-78"]}
